From 65d2924678f0604164a13a427dbdd04392d5690b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xander Burchartz <210020462+xanderburchartz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 12:50:09 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 11/13] chartdldr_pi: group chart sources by continent, iOS
 layout

All platforms:
- chart_sources.xml: sources grouped as Europe / North America / South
  America / Asia and Oceania / World and basemaps. All 97 sources are
  kept; the free European inland ENC catalogs were hidden in an unsorted
  list.
- Names in the tree are translatable and sorted by the shown name; the
  continent of the system locale's country is expanded.
- After adding a source its catalog is fetched at once, so the separate
  "Update" step is no longer needed.

iOS only (#ifdef __OCPN__IOS__): layout of the downloader pages on a phone.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
